Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/demfabris/zz
Description: Terminal multiplexer with terminal, browser, and agent panes
 zz is a terminal multiplexer with three kinds of pane: a terminal, a Chromium
 browser, and an AI agent. They share one split layout, one focus model, one
 set of tmux keys, and one GPU surface. A background daemon keeps the sessions
 alive after you close the window.
 .
 The package carries the complete CEF runtime in /usr/lib/zz and exposes it as
 /usr/bin/zz.
